Package: zinbTruitt
Type: Package
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression via IRLS and EM
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joseph", "Truitt", email = "truittj@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB) regression by iteratively reweighted
    least squares (IRLS) alternated with Newton-Raphson for the dispersion
    parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial (ZINB) regression by an EM
    algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits. No general-purpose optimizer is used.
    Developed for STA 651 at Miami University.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
